      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## KDX Wildcard Studio – 1. Preview the plan (no model needed)\n\nThe quickest way to see the console work. No checkpoint is loaded; the outputs go to Preview nodes.\n\n1. Open the **KDX Wildcard Studio** tab in the left sidebar and click **Import templates** (Impact Pack `templates/` wildcards).\n2. Toggle categories and templates, set **repeat** (number next to a template) and **on_end** per category.\n3. Press **Run** a few times: every run moves the counter. `index` / `repeat_left` count inside a template.\n\nThe node body shows what comes next. **Skip** and **Reset** are in the panel."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## KDX Wildcard Studio – 1. Preview the plan (no model needed)\n\nThe quickest way to see the console work. No checkpoint is loaded; the outputs go to Preview nodes.\n\n1. Open the **KDX Wildcard Studio** tab in the left sidebar and click **Import templates** (Impact Pack `templates/` wildcards).\n2. Toggle categories and templates, set **repeat** (number next to a template) and **on_end** per category.\n3. Press **Run** a few times: every run moves the counter. `index` / `repeat_left` count inside a template.\n\nThe node body shows what comes next. **Skip** and **Reset** are in the panel."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
